<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Remplissage conteneur - Caisses avec profils</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#eef2f5;color:#17202a}
header{background:#17324d;color:#fff;padding:18px}
header h1{margin:0;font-size:22px}
header p{margin:6px 0 0;opacity:.82}
main{max-width:1250px;margin:auto;padding:16px}
.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:350px 1fr;gap:16px}
.card{background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 3px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}
h2{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 12px}
label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;margin:10px 0 5px}
input{width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #cbd4dc;border-radius:9px;font-size:15px}
.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}
button{border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:11px 13px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}
.primary{background:#17324d;color:#fff}.danger{background:#d94b42;color:#fff}
.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:14px}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}
.stat{background:#f0f4f7;border-radius:12px;padding:12px}
.stat span{font-size:12px;color:#66737d}.stat b{display:block;font-size:20px;margin-top:5px}
.progress{height:20px;background:#e2e7eb;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;margin:12px 0 6px}
.bar{height:100%;background:#2878b5;transition:.25s}
.percent{text-align:center;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:15px}
.door-wrap{background:#dce2e6;padding:18px;border-radius:14px}
.door{position:relative;margin:auto;background:#fff;border:6px solid #56636d;width:min(100%,720px);aspect-ratio:2340/2325}
.box{position:absolute;border:2px solid #17324d;background:rgba(49,126,181,.78);color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;overflow:hidden}
.dim{text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#66737d;margin-top:8px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;margin-top:10px}
th,td{padding:8px 5px;border-bottom:1px solid #e4e8eb;text-align:left}
.note{font-size:12px;color:#68747d;line-height:1.45}
.badge{display:inline-block;background:#eef3f7;border-radius:8px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;margin-top:8px}

/* Liste déroulante visuelle avec images */
.dropdown{position:relative}
.dropdown-btn{width:100%;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd4dc;border-radius:9px;padding:7px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-align:left;color:#17202a}
.dropdown-btn:hover{background:#f7f9fa}
.selected-img,.option-img{width:58px;height:48px;object-fit:contain;background:#f3f5f6;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #dce2e6;flex:none}
.selected-info{flex:1;min-width:0}.selected-info strong{display:block;font-size:14px}.selected-info span{display:block;font-size:11px;color:#68747d;margin-top:3px}
.chevron{font-size:18px;color:#68747d}
.dropdown-menu{display:none;position:absolute;z-index:20;left:0;right:0;top:100%;margin-top:5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd4dc;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.15);max-height:430px;overflow:auto;padding:6px}
.dropdown.open .dropdown-menu{display:block}
.option{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:7px;border:0;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;text-align:left;color:#17202a}
.option:hover{background:#edf3f7}
.option-text{flex:1}.option-text strong{display:block;font-size:13px}.option-text span{font-size:11px;color:#68747d}
.placeholder-img{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:19px;color:#8b969d}
@media(max-width:850px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.dropdown-menu{max-height:360px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>📦 Remplissage conteneur — vue portes</h1>
<p>Choix des caisses avec aperçu des profils/châssis issus du fichier Excel.</p>
</header>

<main>
<div class="layout">
<section class="card">
<h2>Dimensions du conteneur</h2>
<div class="row">
<div><label>Largeur (mm)</label><input id="cw" type="number" value="2340"></div>
<div><label>Hauteur (mm)</label><input id="ch" type="number" value="2325"></div>
</div>
<label>Longueur du conteneur (mm)</label>
<input id="cl" type="number" value="12040">
<div class="badge">TC40 : 2340 × 2325 × 12040 mm</div>

<h2 style="margin-top:22px">Choisir une caisse</h2>
<label>Référence / profil</label>
<div class="dropdown" id="dropdown">
  <button class="dropdown-btn" id="dropdownBtn" type="button">
    <div id="selectedImg" class="selected-img placeholder-img">📦</div>
    <div class="selected-info">
      <strong id="selectedRef">Choisir une caisse</strong>
      <span id="selectedDim">Sélectionne une référence</span>
    </div>
    <span class="chevron">▾</span>
  </button>
  <div class="dropdown-menu" id="dropdownMenu"></div>
</div>

<div class="row">
<div><label>Largeur caisse (mm)</label><input id="bw" type="number"></div>
<div><label>Hauteur caisse (mm)</label><input id="bh" type="number"></div>
</div>
<label>Quantité</label>
<input id="qty" type="number" min="1" value="1">

<div class="actions">
<button class="primary" onclick="addItem()">Ajouter</button>
<button class="danger" onclick="resetAll()">Tout effacer</button>
</div>

<p class="note">
Les images affichées dans la liste sont les images de profils/châssis présentes dans ton fichier Excel.
Les dimensions sont automatiquement mises à jour avec la caisse sélectionnée.
</p>
</section>

<section class="card">
<div class="stats">
<div class="stat"><span>Surface ouverture</span><b id="surface"></b></div>
<div class="stat"><span>Surface occupée</span><b id="used"></b></div>
<div class="stat"><span>Surface restante</span><b id="rest"></b></div>
</div>
<div class="progress"><div id="bar" class="bar"></div></div>
<div id="pct" class="percent"></div>

<h2>👁️ Vue depuis les portes</h2>
<div class="door-wrap">
<div id="door" class="door"></div>
<div id="dim" class="dim"></div>
</div>

<h2 style="margin-top:18px">Chargement</h2>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Référence</th><th>Dimensions</th><th>Qté</th><th>Surface</th><th></th></tr></thead>
<tbody id="rows"></tbody>
</table>
</section>
</div>
</main>

<script>
const catalog=[{"ref": "11572599", "w": 520, "h": 570, "image": ""}, {"ref": "11576599", "w": 550, "h": 570, "image": ""}, {"ref": "14685599", "w": 530, "h": 560, "image": ""}, {"ref": "14685699", "w": 530, "h": 550, "image": ""}, {"ref": "15212899", "w": 550, "h": 550, "image": ""}, {"ref": "11383599", "w": 540, "h": 530, "image": ""}, {"ref": "11572499", "w": 550, "h": 520, "image": ""}, {"ref": "11581699", "w": 550, "h": 520, "image": ""}, {"ref": "FR003827", "w": 540, "h": 520, "image": ""}, {"ref": "11576799", "w": 550, "h": 520, "image": ""}, {"ref": "FR003681", "w": 520, "h": 490, "image": ""}, {"ref": "11571499", "w": 550, "h": 490, "image": ""}, {"ref": "11543099", "w": 510, "h": 475, "image": ""}, {"ref": "11325699", "w": 550, "h": 470, "image": ""}, {"ref": "13776299", "w": 540, "h": 470, "image": ""}, {"ref": "11336099", "w": 550, "h": 470, "image": ""}, {"ref": "11577299", "w": 530, "h": 450, "image": ""}, {"ref": "11383499", "w": 550, "h": 420, "image": ""}, {"ref": "FR003682", "w": 540, "h": 420, "image": ""}, {"ref": "14685799", "w": 550, "h": 420, "image": ""}, {"ref": "11576499", "w": 540, "h": 420, "image": ""}, {"ref": "13487699", "w": 510, "h": 380, "image": ""}, {"ref": "11570799", "w": 530, "h": 370, "image": ""}, {"ref": "13487499", "w": 550, "h": 370, "image": ""}, {"ref": "13487399", "w": 550, "h": 350, "image": ""}];
let items=[];
let selected=null;

const dropdown=document.getElementById("dropdown");
const menu=document.getElementById("dropdownMenu");

function imgHtml(item, cls){
  if(item.image) return '<img class="'+cls+'" src="data:image/png;base64,'+item.image+'" alt="Profil '+item.ref+'">';
  return '<div class="'+cls+' placeholder-img">📦</div>';
}

function buildDropdown(){
  menu.innerHTML="";
  catalog.forEach(item=>{
    const b=document.createElement("button");
    b.type="button";
    b.className="option";
    b.innerHTML=imgHtml(item,"option-img")+
      '<div class="option-text"><strong>'+escapeHtml(item.ref)+'</strong><span>'+item.w+' × '+item.h+' mm</span></div>';
    b.addEventListener("click",()=>selectBox(item));
    menu.appendChild(b);
  });
}

function selectBox(item){
  selected=item;
  document.getElementById("selectedImg").outerHTML=imgHtml(item,"selected-img").replace(' alt=', ' id="selectedImg" alt=');
  document.getElementById("selectedRef").textContent=item.ref;
  document.getElementById("selectedDim").textContent=item.w+" × "+item.h+" mm";
  document.getElementById("bw").value=item.w;
  document.getElementById("bh").value=item.h;
  dropdown.classList.remove("open");
}

document.getElementById("dropdownBtn").addEventListener("click",()=>dropdown.classList.toggle("open"));
document.addEventListener("click",e=>{if(!dropdown.contains(e.target))dropdown.classList.remove("open")});

function addItem(){
  if(!selected){alert("Choisis d'abord une caisse dans la liste.");return}
  const w=+document.getElementById("bw").value;
  const h=+document.getElementById("bh").value;
  const q=Math.max(1,+document.getElementById("qty").value||1);
  const old=items.find(x=>x.ref===selected.ref&&x.w===w&&x.h===h);
  if(old) old.qty+=q;
  else items.push({ref:selected.ref,w,h,qty:q,image:selected.image});
  render();
}

function removeItem(i){items.splice(i,1);render()}
function resetAll(){items=[];render()}

function render(){
  const W=+document.getElementById("cw").value||2340;
  const H=+document.getElementById("ch").value||2325;
  const L=+document.getElementById("cl").value||12040;
  const total=W*H;

  const door=document.getElementById("door");
  door.innerHTML="";

  // Expand quantities into individual crates, then sort widest first.
  let crates=[];
  items.forEach(it=>{
    for(let n=0;n<it.qty;n++){
      crates.push({ref:it.ref,w:it.w,h:it.h,image:it.image});
    }
  });
  crates.sort((a,b)=>b.w-a.w || b.h-a.h);

  // Build rows from the bottom upward. Each row uses the widest crates
  // that can fit side-by-side; the row height is the tallest crate in it.
  let remaining=crates.slice();
  let rowsData=[];

  while(remaining.length){
    let row=[];
    let usedW=0;

    for(let i=0;i<remaining.length;){
      const c=remaining[i];

      if(c.w<=W && c.h<=H && usedW+c.w<=W){
        row.push(c);
        usedW+=c.w;
        i++;
      }else{
        i++;
      }
    }

    if(!row.length){
      // No crate can be placed in the current remaining height/width.
      break;
    }

    // Keep each row ordered widest -> narrowest.
    row.sort((a,b)=>b.w-a.w || b.h-a.h);

    const rowH=Math.max(...row.map(c=>c.h));
    rowsData.push({
      crates:row,
      usedW,
      remainingW:W-usedW,
      height:rowH
    });

    // Remove exactly the crates used in this row.
    for(const used of row){
      const idx=remaining.indexOf(used);
      if(idx>=0) remaining.splice(idx,1);
    }

    // Stop if the next row would exceed the opening height.
    const usedHeight=rowsData.reduce((s,r)=>s+r.height,0);
    if(usedHeight>=H) break;
  }

  let usedArea=0;
  let cumulativeH=0;

  // Draw rows from the bottom to the top.
  rowsData.forEach((row,rowIndex)=>{
    const rowBottom=cumulativeH;
    const rowTop=cumulativeH+row.height;
    const remainingHeightAbove=H-rowTop;

    // Row background/guide
    const guide=document.createElement("div");
    guide.style.position="absolute";
    guide.style.left="0";
    guide.style.right="0";
    guide.style.top=((H-rowTop)/H*100)+"%";
    guide.style.height=(row.height/H*100)+"%";
    guide.style.borderTop="1px dashed #9aa6ad";
    guide.style.borderBottom="1px dashed #c3cbd0";
    guide.style.pointerEvents="none";
    door.appendChild(guide);

    let x=0;
    row.crates.forEach(c=>{
      const d=document.createElement("div");
      d.className="box";
      d.style.left=(x/W*100)+"%";
      d.style.top=((H-rowBottom-c.h)/H*100)+"%";
      d.style.width=(c.w/W*100)+"%";
      d.style.height=(c.h/H*100)+"%";
      d.innerHTML=escapeHtml(c.ref)+"<br>"+c.w+"×"+c.h;
      d.title=c.ref+" — "+c.w+" × "+c.h+" mm";
      door.appendChild(d);

      x+=c.w;
      usedArea+=c.w*c.h;
    });

    // Row information at the right side.
    const label=document.createElement("div");
    label.style.position="absolute";
    label.style.right="-1px";
    label.style.top=((H-rowTop)/H*100+0.5)+"%";
    label.style.transform="translateY(-50%)";
    label.style.background="rgba(255,255,255,.94)";
    label.style.border="1px solid #87939b";
    label.style.borderRadius="5px";
    label.style.padding="3px 5px";
    label.style.fontSize="9px";
    label.style.lineHeight="1.2";
    label.style.color="#17202a";
    label.style.zIndex="5";
    label.innerHTML=
      "<b>R"+(rowIndex+1)+"</b><br>"+
      "H rangée : "+row.height+" mm<br>"+
      "L utilisée : "+row.usedW+" mm<br>"+
      "L restante : "+row.remainingW+" mm<br>"+
      "H restante : "+remainingHeightAbove+" mm";
    door.appendChild(label);

    cumulativeH+=row.height;
  });

  // Top information band: remaining width and height above the last row.
  const topRemainingH=Math.max(0,H-cumulativeH);
  const topLabel=document.createElement("div");
  topLabel.style.position="absolute";
  topLabel.style.left="4px";
  topLabel.style.right="4px";
  topLabel.style.top="4px";
  topLabel.style.padding="5px 7px";
  topLabel.style.background="rgba(255,255,255,.94)";
  topLabel.style.border="1px solid #7d8991";
  topLabel.style.borderRadius="6px";
  topLabel.style.fontSize="10px";
  topLabel.style.fontWeight="bold";
  topLabel.style.textAlign="center";
  topLabel.style.zIndex="10";
  const lastRow=rowsData[rowsData.length-1];
  const topRemainingW=lastRow ? lastRow.remainingW : W;
  topLabel.innerHTML=
    "ESPACE LIBRE EN HAUT — Hauteur : "+topRemainingH+
    " mm &nbsp;|&nbsp; Largeur libre : "+topRemainingW+" mm";
  door.appendChild(topLabel);

  if(!rowsData.length){
    door.innerHTML='<div style="position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#78838b;font-weight:bold">OUVERTURE DU CONTENEUR</div>';
  }

  const percent=Math.min(100,usedArea/total*100);
  document.getElementById("surface").textContent=(total/1e6).toFixed(4)+" m²";
  document.getElementById("used").textContent=(usedArea/1e6).toFixed(4)+" m²";
  document.getElementById("rest").textContent=Math.max(0,(total-usedArea)/1e6).toFixed(4)+" m²";
  document.getElementById("bar").style.width=percent+"%";
  document.getElementById("pct").textContent=percent.toFixed(1)+" % rempli";
  document.getElementById("dim").textContent=
    W+" × "+H+" mm — longueur : "+L+" mm ("+(L/1000).toFixed(2)+" m)";

  const rows=document.getElementById("rows");
  rows.innerHTML="";
  items.forEach((it,i)=>{
    const tr=document.createElement("tr");
    tr.innerHTML="<td>"+escapeHtml(it.ref)+"</td><td>"+it.w+" × "+it.h+
      " mm</td><td>"+it.qty+"</td><td>"+(it.w*it.h*it.qty/1e6).toFixed(4)+
      " m²</td><td><button class='danger' onclick='removeItem("+i+")'>×</button></td>";
    rows.appendChild(tr);
  });
}
function escapeHtml(s){
  return String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({"&":"&amp;","<":"&lt;",">":"&gt;",'"':"&quot;","'":"&#039;"}[c]));
}

buildDropdown();
selectBox(catalog[0]);
["cw","ch","cl"].forEach(id=>document.getElementById(id).addEventListener("input",render));
render();
</script>
</body>
</html>
